  "slug": "wild-rocket-arugula-and-parmesan-salad",
  "name": "Wild Rocket (Arugula) and Parmesan Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This wild rocket (arugula) and Parmesan salad recipe combines fresh arugula, cilantro, Parmesan cheese shavings, and an easy lemon-balsamic vinaigrette.",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Toss arugula and cilantro together in a large salad bowl; drizzle with lemon juice, olive oil, and balsamic vinegar. Sprinkle with red pepper flakes and black pepper; toss. Taste and adjust seasonings if desired."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Sprinkle salad with Parmesan cheese shavings; toss then serve."
    }
  ],
